# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers and the WSL2 engine host. With git's
# autocrlf on Windows a CRLF checkout makes bash fail with "$'\r': command not
# found" and "set: pipefail: invalid option name". Scoped deliberately to these
# paths: a repo-wide rule would renormalise every file in the tree on the next
# Windows checkout.
scripts/*.sh text eol=lf
gateway/test/sysbox/*.sh text eol=lf
gateway/test/sysbox/Dockerfile* text eol=lf
